From: Local OpenBMC configuration <root@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Pin X570D4U IPMI sensor numbers and SDR record IDs

Dynamic numbering uses positions in the populated D-Bus sensor tree. PWM
sensors and temporarily absent hardware therefore change existing monitoring
identities. Reserve board sensor numbers and traverse sparse SDR IDs, keeping
FAN6_1 at 5, reserving category ranges for later additions, and keeping
non-sensor records in a separate range.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [X570D4U board sensor ABI]

--- a/dbus-sdr/sdrutils.cpp
